on":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o092b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o092b-q","source_order":[54,415,"O092b"],"related_events":[{"event":"wudi-e-o199b","type":"related","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o092b-q","wudi-e-o199b-q"]}],"order":9737}],"persons":[{"id":"guanzhang-p0002","name":"关平","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o010","wuzhu-q-o036","chenghuang-q-8b3b0fde853ec52e5949"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"guanzhang-m-o010-guanzhang-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-o010"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-p010-guanzhang-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-p010"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-p013-guanzhang-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-p013"]},{"id":"wuzhu-m-o036-guanzhang-p0002","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o036"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-8b3b0fde853ec52e5949","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-e020347f9b719be7d652","layer":"original","quote":"权征关羽，璋与朱然断羽走道。到临沮〖6〗，住夹石〖7〗，璋部下司马马忠擒羽〖8〗，并羽子平、都督赵累等","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":331,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-e-o010c-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-d7695050b7ab7c9718d1","layer":"original","quote":"权遣将逆击羽，斩羽及子平于临沮〖8〗。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-e-p010a-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-deb4718f4002ac03c133","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《蜀记》曰：“权遣将军击羽，获羽及子平。权欲活羽，以敌刘、曹，左右曰：‘狼子不可养！后必为害。曹公不即除之，自取大患，乃议徙都；今岂可生！’乃斩之。”","attribution":"《蜀记》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4a5fb7be9dd6fee324ea","start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-e-p013a-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-8a59afe33e13dca3e137","layer":"pei","quote":"羽初出军围樊，梦猪啮其足；语子平曰：‘吾今年衰矣，然不得还！","attribution":"《蜀记》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8eac082ed139fcab230f","start":10,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-edafc9276d2732d2c2af","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-16dc4b02f597093385c1","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o008","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-b96955cde6bd0ef2541b","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖1〗，先主为汉中王；拜羽为前将军，假节、钺。是岁，羽率众攻曹仁于樊。曹公遣于禁助仁。秋，大霖雨，汉水泛溢，禁所督七军皆没；禁降羽，羽又斩将军庞德〖2〗；梁、郏、陆浑群盗或遥受羽印号〖3〗，为之支党。羽威震华夏〖4〗，曹公议徙许都，以避其锐。司马宣王、蒋济以为：“关羽得志，孙权必不愿也。可遣人劝权蹑其后〖5〗，许割江南以封权，则樊围自解。”曹公从之。","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":35,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-o010","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-d7695050b7ab7c9718d1","layer":"original","quote":"于是权阴诱芳、仁，芳、仁使人迎权。而曹公遣徐晃救曹仁，﹝二﹞羽不能克，引军退还。权已据江陵，尽虏羽士众妻子，羽军遂散。权遣将逆击羽，斩羽及子平于临沮〖8〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-p010","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-deb4718f4002ac03c133","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《蜀记》曰：“权遣将军击羽，获羽及子平。权欲活羽，以敌刘、曹，左右曰：‘狼子不可养！后必为害。曹公不即除之，自取大患，乃议徙都；今岂可生！’乃斩之。”","attribution":"《蜀记》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4a5fb7be9dd6fee324ea","start":0,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-p011-judgment","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-7321306238e0ce7cfa42","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按《吴书》：孙权遣将潘璋，逆断羽走路，羽至即斩；且临沮去江陵二三百里，岂容不时杀羽，方议其生死乎？又云“权欲活羽，以敌刘、曹”，此之不然，可以绝智者之口。","attribution":"裴松之按《吴书》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4a5fb7be9dd6fee324ea","start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-p013","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-8a59afe33e13dca3e137","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《蜀记》曰：“羽初出军围樊，梦猪啮其足；语子平曰：‘吾今年衰矣，然不得还！’”《江表传》曰：“羽好《左氏传》，讽诵略皆上口。”","attribution":"《蜀记》《江表传》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8eac082ed139fcab230f","start":0,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o199b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-de411566fbf9cdd8658d","layer":"original","quote":"权击斩羽，传其首。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":444,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wufan-q-790f876ad292793303fb","section":"chapter-063","block":"b-c41c0565cf67aa38c9ac","layer":"original","quote":"权立表下漏以待之〖13〗。及〔日〕中不至，权问其故，范曰：“时尚未正中也。”顷之，有风动帷。范拊手曰：“羽至矣！”须臾，外称“万岁〖14〗”，传言得羽","section_title":"吴范刘惇赵达传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0133.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":122,"end":197,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o035c-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-83834db77f87d5f2c6c1","layer":"original","quote":"关羽还当阳〖18〗，西保麦城〖19〗。权使诱之。羽伪降，立幡旗为象人于城上〖20〗，因遁走；兵皆解散，尚十余骑。权先使朱然、潘璋断其径路〖21〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":105,"end":178,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-37844cc033f6c2f91e32","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，璋司马马忠，获羽及其子平、都督赵累等于章乡〖22〗，遂定荆州。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":153,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-39b849dfb87fdd3c9c49","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年〖8〗，关羽围曹仁于襄阳；曹公遣左将军于禁救之〖9〗。会汉水暴起，羽以舟兵尽虏禁等步骑三万，送江陵，惟城未拔。权内惮羽，外欲以为己功；笺与曹公〖10〗，乞以讨羽自效〖11〗。曹公且欲使羽与权相持以斗之，驿传权书；使曹仁以弩射示羽，羽犹豫不能去。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o036","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-37844cc033f6c2f91e32","layer":"original","quote":"十二月，璋司马马忠，获羽及其子平、都督赵累等于章乡〖22〗，遂定荆州。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":153,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o092b-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-4d7403165ca63fd7da46","layer":"original","quote":"权使朱然、潘璋，断其径路；即父子俱获，荆州遂定。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":414,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-83ae4f607ccac09e5a22","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-fa0cf6fd43803c809a9b","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十四年，从讨关羽；别与潘璋到临沮擒羽，迁昭武将军，封西安乡侯","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":56,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
